==English==

===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:dependen<ety:der<fro:dependre<ety:der<la:dependeō>>>>|text=++|tree=1}} In this sense, displaced native {{ncog|ang|hangian||to hang or depend}}.

===Pronunciation===
